NAME: Clock

DESCRIPTION:

Displays analog clock.

Also displays sunrise, sunset, midday 
times, and daytime length.

NOTES:

The sunrise and sunset times are 
calculated using the equation from
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunrise_equation#Hour_angle.

To validate the calculated sunrise/set 
times, the sunrise and set times were 
obtained from 
  https://api.sunrise-sunset.org.
There is a 2 minute difference between 
the calculated and web obtained times.

Obtaining the sunrise/sunset times from
  https://api.sunrise-sunset.org
was done during development, that code 
is now commented out.
